Alembic Migration Directory
===========================

This directory contains database migrations for the vDrive Onboarding Service.

Usage
-----

1. Create a new migration:
   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"

2. Apply all pending migrations:
   alembic upgrade head

3. Rollback one migration:
   alembic downgrade -1

4. Show current revision:
   alembic current

5. Show migration history:
   alembic history

Notes
-----

- The database URL is loaded from environment variables via src.app.core.config
- Migrations use async support with SQLAlchemy asyncpg driver
- Always review autogenerated migrations before applying to production
